  "correct": "A",
  "explanation": "The lines must be parallel with different intercepts. Multiplying the first left side by 5/2 gives 5x+(25/2)y, so a=25/2. Its right side would be 1/2, which differs from 2/25; hence the lines are distinct and the system is inconsistent.",
